WEBVTT

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.310
What, for crying out loud?

00:00:57.310 --> 00:00:59.520
Sorry I'm late, everyone!

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.530
Gohan, what's the deal with that outfit?

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:10.360
Mother said I should be
neat and tidy when I come.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:15.330
We're just camping here!
What was your mommy thinking?

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.540
And that rucksack is incredible.
What do you have inside it?

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:24.710
Right! Mother packed
all kinds of things for me.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:30.130
Language, arithmetic, science
and social studies reference books,

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.340
along with my sleep-study set.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:38.020
I also have mosquito repellent,
a bellywarmer and a pillow.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:43.110
My alarm clock...
this is a pouch of curry...

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:45.570
and I have all of
this canned food...

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:51.570
Let's see, I also have...
this, and that, and such...

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.560
Fire!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.370
Hurry! We have to get upwind of it!

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:24.250
W-which way is upwind!?
W-w-which way!?

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:28.460
Gohan! We'll knock
the flames out using our Ki!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.420
Can you do that!?

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:31.840
Yes!

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.420
All right!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:35.400
Now's your chance!

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:02.260
For a minute, I wasn't sure
what would become of us.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.430
Thank goodness.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:08.190
The animals have been put out.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.240
Poor guys.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.280
G-Gohan...

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:25.200
Bulma-san, would you
lend us your Dragon Radar?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.080
The Dragon Radar?

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.290
Oh, yeah!

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.300
You're such good boys.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:40.510
Kuririn-san!

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:58.280
Break through the shining clouds,
and fly away (fly away)

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:05.450
As a panorama spreads itself
throughout my being!

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:11.210
The earth, having been kicked
in the face, gets angry (angry)!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:17.880
And makes one of its
volcanoes explode!

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:24.300
If, within the thawed polar ice,

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:33.270
There is a dinosaur, then I want
to train him to balance atop a ball.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:36.520
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:45.870
No matter what may happen,
I feel as though nothing can bother me,

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:49.330
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:55.290
However hard your chest pounds,
the Genki Dama will roar!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.460
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:07.470
The emptier your head is,
the more room there is to pack with dreams,

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:11.310
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:18.320
With a cheerful face and an Ultra-Z,
today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai...

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.150
Sparking!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.240
Haiya Dragon!

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.490
Come back!

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:26.260
Don't do that! Shen Long is going
to return your forest back to normal!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.340
Right?

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.390
Shen Long does have a scary face, and all.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:36.350
It's no wonder Haiya Dragon was frightened.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:45.320
Now, speak forth thy wish.
I shall grant thee any one wish.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:49.320
Please make this forest
the pretty forest it was before!

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.370
That is a simple matter.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:30.360
I have granted thy wish.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:34.280
Farewell!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:08.530
That tickles!

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:21.310
Tullece-sama, there are
life signs coming from Earth.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:27.230
There couldn't be. Earth is the
planet that Kakarrot was sent to...

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:28.480
...long ago.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.400
Then again, it is too beautiful.

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:39.410
Tullece-sama, you will be most pleased.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:44.080
Earth's soil appears to be
suitable for growing the Shinseiju tree.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:54.170
Goku-sa, how's the water?

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.340
Not quite warm enough, Chichi.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.300
Father, let's have a contest.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.300
All right!

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:21.370
G-Goku-sa!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.460
I lost.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.420
Haiya Dragon!

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.050
G-Gohan-chan!

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:39.390
See? This is the friend
I was telling you about earlier.

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.390
I'm impressed
that you found my home.

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.350
Isn't he cute?

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.350
W-which part?

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:51.190
Gohan-chan!

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:55.360
Really, Gohan-chan,
you are fast becomin' a bad child!

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.530
Ever since you started
playin' with Goku-sa's friends,

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:00.030
you don't study in the least!

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.370
Chichi, ain't that enough already?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.370
Goku-sa, you just hush.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:09.370
Havin' come to this point,
I can't let him play anymore.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.460
But I do study.

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:14.380
That's what makes you my Gohan-chan.

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:17.470
So I can keep Haiya Dragon, can't I?

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:20.390
Send it back to the mountains!

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:23.470
I just can't deal with those things.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:24.470
But...

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:28.310
You understand me?
Send it back, right now!

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:36.230
I'm sorry, but you have to go
back to the mountains, okay?

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.030
I'll come visit you later.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.450
Please, go bye-bye.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.450
No, I said.

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.540
What am I going to do with you?

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:57.380
Gohan!

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.730
How do you like it, Gohan?

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:18.990
Thank you, Father!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.910
But don't tell your mother!

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.510
Well, Pu-erh, how's the ride?

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.340
It's the best!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:44.550
Isn’t it, isn't it? I bought it
on a 15-year loan, after all.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.060
I'm surprised someone
offered you that much credit.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:54.060
Well, I did become famous overnight
because of the Tenkaichi Tournament.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.650
Everyone will be so
surprised when we show up in this!

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:57.820
They sure will!

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:03.030
Yamucha-sama...

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.660
What is that Ki!?

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.870
For a little while now,
I've been sensing an ominous Ki...

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.330
Take firm root, now.

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:05.470
Hurry and bear fruit.

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.820
Does that feel good?

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:45.090
Gohan! Suppertime!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:47.970
Okay!

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:50.600
We'll play again later, okay?

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:52.890
Bye!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:54.160
To think that Earth would be an
ideal planet to grow Shinseiju fruit on...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:18:00.170
This is all thanks to Kakarrot
leaving the planet unharmed.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.290
Help!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.750
Wow, you had a rough time of it, huh?

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.960
Yeah. My whole 15-year loan, all gone.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:12.550
Thank you. Sorry to suddenly drop in like this.

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:15.300
Why did you buy something so expensive!?

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.470
You're trying to be popular
with other girls again, huh!?

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:19.300
N-no, i-it's not like that...

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:23.470
You never think ahead, and just buy things!

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:30.480
Chichi-san, thanks for
going to all this trouble for us.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:35.150
Don't be silly. As long as you
don't interfere with Gohan's studyin',

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.320
you stay as long as you like.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:40.240
I could help teach him his lessons, okay?

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.540
That's what I'm most worried about.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:56.260
H-Haiya Dragon!

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:02.430
Gohan-chan! Haven't you
sent that thing back yet?

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:04.430
W-well, you see...

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:09.650
W-where's the harm?

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:13.690
Goku-sa, you're conspirin'
with Gohan-chan again!

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.530
I-I wouldn't say that...

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:20.240
We can't do this
outside the cave, you know!

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.500
--What's the matter?
--Gohan-chan!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.330
We've got guests! Send it away at once!

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:30.330
Okay!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.380
Sorry about this, but wait
for me at the cave, okay?

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.630
No, I can't play right now.

00:21:41.220 --> 00:21:42.970
No!

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:51.400
He seemed to be acting strange, huh?

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:53.020
It just wants to play.

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:54.980
Goku...

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:57.070
Kaio-sama?

00:21:57.070 --> 00:22:00.860
Goku, something terrible has happened.

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:01.990
Something terrible?

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:07.870
A ghastly tree called a Shinseiju
has taken root across the whole Earth.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:09.160
Shinseiju?

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:14.920
Ordinarily, only Kami-sama are
allowed to eat of the fruit of this tree.

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:17.090
Once a Shinseiju takes root,

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:21.880
it bears fruit until it has sucked
all of the nourishment out of the land,

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:24.180
while the surrounding plants wither away.

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:27.180
The planet becomes a desert wasteland,

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:29.930
and it's said that
not even a blade of grass

00:22:29.940 --> 00:22:32.940
will grow in its soil
for several centuries afterward.

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:35.110
How can that be?

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:39.860
In other words, once it has
taken root it is already too late.

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:43.110
Its fruit will suck all of
the nutrients out of the Earth,

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:46.950
and in the end, it will
turn the world into a desert.

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:53.420
Then, our Earth is-!?

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:58.960
Unfortunately, it's too late.

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:01.220
I can't believe that!

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:09.770
A little longer, and the fruit will be ripe.

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:12.940
After eating the fruit which has
absorbed this much of the Earth's energy,

00:23:12.940 --> 00:23:16.400
our power will rise once again.

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:19.110
The Crusher Tullece Corps,
strongest in the universe,

00:23:19.110 --> 00:23:22.900
will be invincible wherever we go!

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:25.030
Even Freeza will be easy to handle.

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:29.330
Tullece-sama will be
the emperor of the universe!

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:31.040
Da!

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:36.130
And it's all thanks to the Shinseiju fruit.

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:37.250
No.

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:42.920
It's thanks to that foolish Kakarrot.

00:23:46.220 --> 00:23:48.970
The trees are all going to wither and die!?

00:23:48.970 --> 00:23:50.970
And all the water will be gone?

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:54.230
I don't know.

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:59.690
But once it takes root, it's too late, right?

00:24:00.820 --> 00:24:03.150
If we put all of our powers together,

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:06.160
we should be able to blow
the tree away, roots and all!

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:09.990
That's right! Let's do it, guys!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:10.990
--Yeah!
--All right!

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:14.000
Let's go!

00:24:16.170 --> 00:24:19.170
Gohan, you can't go.

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:23.840
Aww...

00:24:33.520 --> 00:24:36.980
And after Shen Long went to the trouble
of returning this forest back to normal.

00:24:36.980 --> 00:24:39.980
Who the hell would do this?

00:24:39.980 --> 00:24:42.070
All right, here goes!

00:25:13.890 --> 00:25:15.520
Goku, let's try again!

00:25:15.520 --> 00:25:18.190
It's no use! It doesn't look like
we can get rid of these roots

00:25:18.190 --> 00:25:20.230
without blowing the Earth to bits!

00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:48.170
Nobody can destroy the Shinseiju tree.

00:25:48.180 --> 00:25:54.010
I can sense an incredible Ki
from them. Who are these guys?

00:25:54.010 --> 00:25:57.980
You're the ones who
planted this tree, ain't you?

00:25:57.980 --> 00:26:04.020
Anyone who gets in our
way will lose their lives.

00:26:04.020 --> 00:26:08.030
You guys caused that explosion, huh?

00:26:08.030 --> 00:26:11.110
Give me back my new car, you bastards!

00:26:11.110 --> 00:26:12.870
Da!

00:26:12.870 --> 00:26:18.200
These guys don't look like Saiyans,
but I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:26:20.120 --> 00:26:24.040
I wonder if he doesn't like me anymore.

00:26:30.970 --> 00:26:35.050
Maybe he went back to the
forest because I got so mad at him.

00:26:40.020 --> 00:26:41.850
Haiya Dragon!

00:26:57.120 --> 00:26:59.120
I'll get you back for my loan!

00:27:13.090 --> 00:27:14.050
Chaozu!

00:27:24.060 --> 00:27:25.980
Raisin!

00:27:25.980 --> 00:27:26.980
Rakasei!

00:27:26.980 --> 00:27:29.980
We are twin brothers!

00:27:29.990 --> 00:27:32.070
Taiyo-ken!!

00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:46.920
Kienzan!!

00:27:59.100 --> 00:28:00.180
Take this!

00:28:00.180 --> 00:28:03.270
Hmph! If you want to win, you do this!

00:28:21.830 --> 00:28:23.000
D-damn!

00:28:28.000 --> 00:28:29.090
Sokidan!!

00:28:57.030 --> 00:28:58.070
Yamucha!

00:29:01.080 --> 00:29:04.120
You'll have to take me on!

00:29:16.550 --> 00:29:19.050
Pull a clever stunt like that, will you!?

00:29:27.060 --> 00:29:28.850
W-who's there!?

00:29:28.850 --> 00:29:32.020
Stop messing up the animals' forest!

00:29:32.020 --> 00:29:35.110
Tch, this isn't my lucky day.
I'm facing another kid.

00:29:39.030 --> 00:29:41.120
He's strong.

00:29:41.120 --> 00:29:44.870
That kid couldn't be...

00:29:48.040 --> 00:29:49.870
...a Saiyan?

00:29:49.880 --> 00:29:53.340
This time, I'm not holding back!
Brace yourself!

00:29:56.050 --> 00:29:58.130
Masenko!!

00:30:08.100 --> 00:30:11.020
W-what the hell just happened?

00:30:12.110 --> 00:30:14.060
Where did that kid go!?

00:30:14.070 --> 00:30:16.070
Right here!

00:30:16.070 --> 00:30:16.980
What!?

00:30:22.070 --> 00:30:23.160
I did it!

00:30:25.990 --> 00:30:28.870
This kid is the genuine article.

00:30:32.920 --> 00:30:37.920
That's strange. Where could
Haiya Dragon have gone?

00:30:37.920 --> 00:30:41.010
Could he be hiding somewhere?

00:30:41.010 --> 00:30:43.090
I hope he's safe-

00:30:48.890 --> 00:30:50.890
Father?

00:30:50.890 --> 00:30:54.980
Oh, I see, so you're Kakarrot's son.

00:30:56.900 --> 00:30:58.730
You're not Father!

00:31:03.070 --> 00:31:07.080
It's not surprising that
Kakarrot and I should look alike.

00:31:07.080 --> 00:31:11.160
We disposable lower-class
warriors only come in a few types.

00:31:15.920 --> 00:31:18.090
Battle power 10,000.

00:31:18.090 --> 00:31:21.920
I should have figured as much,
inheriting Saiyan blood like you do.

00:31:23.090 --> 00:31:24.180
W-who are you!?

00:31:24.180 --> 00:31:27.930
Me? I am...

00:31:27.930 --> 00:31:30.140
A-a Saiyan!

00:31:30.140 --> 00:31:33.060
Yes. My name is Tullece.

00:31:33.060 --> 00:31:36.060
T-Tullece?

00:31:36.060 --> 00:31:40.070
Listen, boy, would you
like to come with me?

00:31:40.070 --> 00:31:42.150
We'll roam through space
wherever we want to go,

00:31:42.150 --> 00:31:44.150
destroying any planets we like,

00:31:44.160 --> 00:31:47.160
eating delicious foods
and drinking delicious wines.

00:31:47.160 --> 00:31:49.990
There is no more
enjoyable life than this.

00:31:54.920 --> 00:31:56.830
Who do you think is going to join you!?

00:31:58.920 --> 00:32:03.170
Hey, now, don't be so harsh.

00:32:03.170 --> 00:32:08.180
We're among the
few surviving Saiyans.

00:32:08.180 --> 00:32:10.180
Let's get along, now.

00:32:15.850 --> 00:32:22.940
This beautiful blue planet is already doomed
to become a rust-colored, dried-up world.

00:32:22.940 --> 00:32:29.200
You're better off coming with me.
Unless you'd rather die like this?

00:32:33.040 --> 00:32:37.040
Something's coming. Battle power 18,000.

00:32:37.040 --> 00:32:38.210
Who is it?

00:32:48.140 --> 00:32:49.970
What do you want?

00:32:49.970 --> 00:32:53.140
P-Piccolo-san!

00:32:53.140 --> 00:32:55.940
Take your hands off of Gohan.

00:32:55.940 --> 00:32:58.020
I must politely decline.

00:32:58.020 --> 00:32:59.190
Don't mess with me!

00:33:04.860 --> 00:33:07.030
--P-Piccolo-san!
--Are you okay?

00:33:07.030 --> 00:33:08.200
Yeah.

00:33:26.050 --> 00:33:29.640
As a Saiyan, you should live
in a way more befitting a Saiyan.

00:33:31.970 --> 00:33:35.220
Otherwise, that fine tail of yours will weep.

00:33:42.070 --> 00:33:46.190
Let me show you the correct way to use it.

00:33:46.190 --> 00:33:48.990
The way that will make you

00:33:48.990 --> 00:33:51.990
the most keenly aware
that you are a Saiyan!

00:34:03.630 --> 00:34:05.210
Do you know what this is?

00:34:05.210 --> 00:34:07.170
It's the moon.

00:34:12.010 --> 00:34:13.930
Burst open and blend together!

00:34:31.910 --> 00:34:35.830
Boy, show me your Saiyan power!

00:34:44.170 --> 00:34:45.840
Don't look, Gohan!

00:35:08.150 --> 00:35:11.070
Can't have me becoming an ape, too.

00:35:11.070 --> 00:35:15.910
But the effect of my power
ball will last a little longer.

00:35:15.910 --> 00:35:19.160
Now, show me your primary form.

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:25.170
Leave my Gohan alone!

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:29.880
Die!

00:35:46.110 --> 00:35:47.190
You guys...

00:35:48.860 --> 00:35:50.190
...are in my way!!

00:36:10.050 --> 00:36:11.130
G-Gohan!

00:36:13.340 --> 00:36:14.340
Gohan!

00:36:16.050 --> 00:36:17.050
Kaio-ken!!

00:36:32.860 --> 00:36:33.860
Gohan!

00:36:51.880 --> 00:36:55.050
The child kills his father.
Thus are the Saiyans.

00:36:55.050 --> 00:36:57.890
Kakarrot, after you're dead,

00:36:57.890 --> 00:37:00.890
I will look after your kid, so rest easy.

00:37:00.890 --> 00:37:02.890
Son! Cut off his tail!

00:37:07.850 --> 00:37:09.900
--Piccolo!
--Do not interfere!

00:37:09.900 --> 00:37:11.900
You don't know when to die!

00:37:36.090 --> 00:37:38.180
Gohan! Gohan!

00:38:04.370 --> 00:38:06.700
Smash him against
the rocks like an insect!

00:39:12.150 --> 00:39:13.940
Why does someone like you,

00:39:13.940 --> 00:39:17.190
who has inherited the blood
of the mightiest of warriors, the Saiyans,

00:39:17.190 --> 00:39:21.030
show pity to a lower
life form like that?

00:39:23.110 --> 00:39:27.450
Gohan and me ain't Saiyans!
We're Earthlings!

00:39:28.330 --> 00:39:30.330
Are you sure about that?

00:39:47.350 --> 00:39:48.350
Gohan!

00:39:52.140 --> 00:39:55.230
How about now? Can you
still say he's not a Saiyan?

00:40:06.490 --> 00:40:08.620
You fool! You think
you're a match for me!?

00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:17.040
Looks like I was
uncharacteristically optimistic

00:40:17.040 --> 00:40:20.050
about taking the traitor
Kakarrot's kid with me, after all.

00:40:23.130 --> 00:40:24.930
Die!!

00:40:25.930 --> 00:40:27.050
Gohan!

00:40:51.990 --> 00:40:54.120
F-Father...

00:40:56.000 --> 00:41:00.000
Father, protect the earth...

00:41:01.340 --> 00:41:02.380
Gohan!

00:41:04.420 --> 00:41:08.590
I don't know about the earth,
but I'll protect you, at least!

00:41:10.180 --> 00:41:14.930
And I am definitely
going to defeat that guy!

00:42:13.160 --> 00:42:16.540
Kakarrot, you're a
disgrace to the Saiyan race!

00:42:16.540 --> 00:42:20.420
I ain't Kakarrot! I'm Son Goku!

00:42:20.420 --> 00:42:24.460
Tullece-sama, please
allow us to deal with him.

00:42:30.510 --> 00:42:36.470
These guys seemed to fight pretty well,
but they're still no match for us.

00:42:42.310 --> 00:42:45.110
That was a close call earlier.

00:42:45.110 --> 00:42:47.320
You guys stand aside!

00:42:47.320 --> 00:42:49.490
Don't you look down your nose at us!

00:43:06.210 --> 00:43:09.210
You sure are in a fine position,
watching from a distance, huh!?

00:43:26.320 --> 00:43:28.150
That hurt a little bit.

00:43:35.320 --> 00:43:37.330
You guys are in my way!

00:43:56.350 --> 00:44:00.470
Kakarrot, if you kneel
before me and apologize,

00:44:00.470 --> 00:44:04.520
I will allow you and your kid to join me.

00:44:04.520 --> 00:44:07.400
I told you! I'm Son Goku!

00:44:07.400 --> 00:44:11.780
I've been repeatedly eating
the fruit of the Shinseiju.

00:44:11.780 --> 00:44:13.700
You think you can beat me?

00:44:15.740 --> 00:44:19.780
The difference in our powers
is like that of heaven and earth.

00:44:19.790 --> 00:44:22.620
You won't know that until you try me!

00:45:03.080 --> 00:45:08.000
I really am glad
that I hit my head as a baby!

00:45:08.000 --> 00:45:11.000
That's because I got away
with not being like you!

00:45:13.840 --> 00:45:17.840
I can't let you leave like this!

00:45:17.840 --> 00:45:20.100
B-battle power 30,000!

00:45:29.060 --> 00:45:32.900
What is with this guy?
His battle power is skyrocketing!

00:45:59.640 --> 00:46:00.970
I've won.

00:46:26.040 --> 00:46:30.120
You won't be able to face me
now with that kind of battle power.

00:46:30.120 --> 00:46:33.040
I'll dig a grave for you
right in the middle of this world,

00:46:33.040 --> 00:46:35.040
as it turns into a desert.

00:46:39.050 --> 00:46:43.970
It's the least I can do for you,
since we were both born Sayians.

00:46:50.850 --> 00:46:55.190
Is that all the power you've got!?
See if you can entertain me some more!

00:46:57.900 --> 00:47:01.910
Kaio-ken... times ten!!

00:47:21.130 --> 00:47:23.130
Now, kneel...

00:47:23.140 --> 00:47:27.100
If you kneel and beg for
your life, I will forgive you.

00:47:27.100 --> 00:47:33.060
I-I promised Gohan... I-I can't lose...

00:47:33.060 --> 00:47:34.900
What will it be, Kakarrot?

00:47:34.900 --> 00:47:38.070
I'm... Son Goku!

00:47:38.070 --> 00:47:39.900
In that case, die!

00:47:56.000 --> 00:48:00.090
You're just a lower-class
fighter after all. What a disgrace.

00:48:00.090 --> 00:48:02.170
But I'm not like you.

00:48:02.170 --> 00:48:06.180
Using the Shinseiju fruit, I will bring
the whole universe to its knees!

00:48:15.190 --> 00:48:20.150
G-Goku... a Genki Dama...

00:48:20.150 --> 00:48:24.070
H-hit him with a Genki Dama...

00:48:24.070 --> 00:48:27.820
Piccolo... Yamucha...

00:48:27.830 --> 00:48:32.160
I can't... I don't have the power left...

00:48:32.160 --> 00:48:38.170
G-Goku... don't forget, I'm here, too...

00:48:38.170 --> 00:48:40.670
Me, too...

00:48:40.670 --> 00:48:44.090
Kuririn... Chaozu...

00:48:44.090 --> 00:48:48.180
I'm still alive, too!

00:48:48.180 --> 00:48:51.140
Father...

00:48:51.140 --> 00:48:52.810
G-Gohan!

00:48:56.150 --> 00:48:58.150
A-all of you...

00:49:09.030 --> 00:49:11.200
You're still alive, are you?

00:49:15.040 --> 00:49:16.870
You are persistent.

00:49:21.050 --> 00:49:23.960
T-the Land...

00:49:23.960 --> 00:49:26.170
the Seas...

00:49:26.180 --> 00:49:27.880
the Skies...

00:49:31.180 --> 00:49:36.140
...and everyone drawing
breath on this world at this time...

00:49:36.140 --> 00:49:39.100
...share your Genki energy with me!

00:49:39.100 --> 00:49:42.860
For all of your sakes...
for the Earth's sake...

00:49:44.190 --> 00:49:47.950
...give me your Genki energy!

00:49:50.200 --> 00:49:51.950
Kakarrot?

00:50:07.220 --> 00:50:09.050
Out of my way!

00:50:42.840 --> 00:50:44.500
It's done!

00:50:50.220 --> 00:50:53.850
W-what?

00:50:53.850 --> 00:50:58.020
You are not getting away with this!
Tullece, take this!

00:51:23.330 --> 00:51:27.920
T-the earth's Genki energy
has been absorbed by the Shinseiju tree,

00:51:27.920 --> 00:51:31.010
so the Genki for
the Genki Dama wasn't enough.

00:51:31.010 --> 00:51:33.840
I-it's all over now...

00:51:41.640 --> 00:51:44.650
With all of these,
there is nothing for me to fear.

00:52:49.750 --> 00:52:53.760
So warm... W-what is this?

00:53:11.400 --> 00:53:13.400
S-Son...

00:53:14.780 --> 00:53:19.870
Goku is gathering Ki
from the Shinseiju...

00:53:46.310 --> 00:53:48.140
So warm...

00:53:55.820 --> 00:53:56.900
Tullece!

00:54:04.330 --> 00:54:07.000
Kakarrot, are you still around!?

00:54:07.000 --> 00:54:09.170
You are not getting away with this.

00:57:23.490 --> 00:57:25.490
Haiya Dragon!

00:57:26.820 --> 00:57:31.910
With the Shinseiju withering and dying,
the earth just might be spared.

00:57:33.330 --> 00:57:37.500
It's because the Shinseiju fruit
shared its energy with Son Goku,

00:57:37.500 --> 00:57:42.340
the same Shinseiju fruit
that had absorbed the earth's energy,

00:57:42.340 --> 00:57:46.260
that he was able to
create a super Genki Dama.

00:57:46.260 --> 00:57:53.310
And with that mass of nourishment
now raining down like a shower,

00:57:53.310 --> 00:57:58.310
it is giving its power to all living things.

00:58:34.260 --> 00:58:37.220
Son-kun, it really is a good
thing you bumped your head

00:58:37.230 --> 00:58:39.230
when you were a baby, huh?

00:58:39.230 --> 00:58:40.390
It sure is.

00:58:40.400 --> 00:58:43.310
Otherwise, you might
have ganged up with Tullece,

00:58:43.320 --> 00:58:46.280
and ravaged the universe with them.

00:58:47.490 --> 00:58:52.280
And as a result, I still have the scar here.

00:58:52.280 --> 00:58:55.490
Hey, Haiya Dragon,
I hear you played a big role.

00:58:55.490 --> 00:58:59.210
You've got a lot of guts, don't you?

00:59:01.370 --> 00:59:06.300
T-this guy is just like Piccolo!
He only lets his guard down for Gohan!

00:59:06.300 --> 00:59:08.380
That was close, that was close!

00:59:27.440 --> 00:59:29.530
Look, right behind us,
the gods of destruction!

00:59:29.530 --> 00:59:31.360
I am able to see them!

00:59:31.360 --> 00:59:35.280
Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!)

00:59:35.280 --> 00:59:37.280
Look, right next to us,
the gods of destruction!

00:59:37.290 --> 00:59:38.990
They stretch out their arms
and there's an explosion!

00:59:39.000 --> 00:59:42.370
Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!)

00:59:42.370 --> 00:59:49.550
They're coming after us,
cloaked in darkness,

00:59:49.550 --> 00:59:58.180
but right now, the energy we
have to face them is uncertain.

00:59:58.180 --> 01:00:03.190
You all do a handstand
to lend your support,

01:00:03.190 --> 01:00:04.520
just a little power.

01:00:04.520 --> 01:00:12.440
I'll put it all together,
and send it along!

01:00:12.450 --> 01:00:16.410
The whole world wants to be saved,

01:00:16.410 --> 01:00:21.540
the whole world believes,

01:00:21.540 --> 01:00:28.340
in all of their dreams.

01:00:28.340 --> 01:00:30.340
Look, right before our eyes,
the gods of destruction!

01:00:30.340 --> 01:00:31.550
I am able to feel them!

01:00:31.550 --> 01:00:35.470
Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!)

01:00:35.470 --> 01:00:37.550
Look, right near us,
the gods of destruction!

01:00:37.550 --> 01:00:39.390
I am able to see them!

01:00:39.390 --> 01:00:43.430
Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!)
